{"detail":{"kickoff":"2026-06-15T02:00:00.000Z","round":1,"group":"F","home":"Suède","away":"Tunisie","matchId":"UaJKzaHN","status":3,"statusText":"finished","scoreHome":5,"scoreAway":1,"homeId":"OQyqbHWB","awayId":"QqZVYk95"},"commentary":{"periods":[{"period":"1st Half","scoreHome":"2","scoreAway":"1"},{"period":"2nd Half","scoreHome":"3","scoreAway":"0"}],"incidents":[{"period":"1st Half","minute":"7'","type":"goal","side":"home","player":"Ayari Y.","score":"1:0","text":"Goal! Yasin Ayari (Sweden) picks up the ball from a rebound and from the edge of the box he unleashes a shot into the top right corner. It's 1:0."},{"period":"1st Half","minute":"30'","type":"goal","side":"home","player":"Isak A.","score":"2:0","text":"Goal! Alexander Isak (Sweden) weaves his way past opponents, and he unleashes a low drive from the edge of the box into the middle of the net, leaving Abdelmouhib Chamakh beaten. The score is 2:0."},{"period":"1st Half","minute":"30'","type":"assist","side":"home","player":"Gyökeres V.","score":"2:0","text":null},{"period":"1st Half","minute":"43'","type":"goal","side":"away","player":"Rekik O.","score":"2:1","text":"Goal! Hannibal Mejbri swings the ball deep into the box and finds Omar Rekik (Tunisia) unmarked, and his close-range header flies past the keeper into the bottom left corner. 2:1."},{"period":"1st Half","minute":"43'","type":"assist","side":"away","player":"Mejbri H.","score":"2:1","text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"54'","type":"yellow_card","side":"away","player":"Khedira R.","score":null,"text":"This yellow card was deserved. The tackle by Rani Khedira (Tunisia) was quite harsh and Yael Perez didn't hesitate to show him a yellow card."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"59'","type":"goal","side":"home","player":"Gyökeres V.","score":"3:1","text":"GOAL! A terrible mistake leads to a goal. The defender ends up losing possession, allowing Viktor Gyökeres (Sweden) to pick up the ball before slotting it into the back of the net to make it 3:1."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"59'","type":"assist","side":"home","player":"Isak A.","score":"3:1","text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"65'","type":"sub_out","side":"home","player":"Gudmundsson G.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"65'","type":"sub_in","side":"home","player":"Stroud E.","score":null,"text":"Problems for Graham Potter as Gabriel Gudmundsson (Sweden) is not able to play anymore. His injury is too serious and Elliot Stroud replaces him."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"65'","type":"sub_out","side":"home","player":"Nygren B.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"65'","type":"sub_in","side":"home","player":"Bergvall L.","score":null,"text":"Graham Potter decides to make a substitution. Benjamin Nygren will be replaced by Lucas Bergvall (Sweden)."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"72'","type":"sub_out","side":"away","player":"Saad E.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"72'","type":"sub_in","side":"away","player":"Tounekti S.","score":null,"text":"The manager makes a subsitution with Sebastian Tounekti (Tunisia) coming on for Elias Saad."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"72'","type":"sub_out","side":"away","player":"Valery Y.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"72'","type":"sub_in","side":"away","player":"Belhadj M.","score":null,"text":"Sabri Lamouchi has decided to substitute Yan Valery and he is replaced by Mohamed Belhadj (Tunisia)."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"72'","type":"sub_out","side":"away","player":"Skhiri E.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"72'","type":"sub_in","side":"away","player":"Achouri E.","score":null,"text":"The game has come to an end for Ellyes Skhiri. He has contributed as much as he could today. He will be replaced by the fresh legs of Elias Achouri (Tunisia)."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"83'","type":"sub_out","side":"away","player":"Khedira R.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","min